//   Errors: detailedRpcError(error, method) rethrow with context.
// handleVmServerRequest(message, runtime, user) (10877): server-initiated VM
//   requests (from bridges) -> isVmForbiddenServerRequest gate + runSaVmTool +
//   respondToCodexServerRequest routing back to the originating bridge.

